Box 50631, goal 24061: the owner typed „დათო ელექტრიკოსსაც ჰკითხე, ახლავე."
and the ask was refused at 08:31:09 by the full-wave cap (A2, #1685), not
by the order gate. The D625 exception never fired: the declined-name match
knew the case endings („-ს", „-მა", „-ის") but not the „also" particle that
rides on them („-საც", „-მაც", „-ისაც"), so it read the owner's own named
person as nobody. The particle, and only it, may now follow an ending. The
old test that held „მძღოლსაც" as nobody was that bug; it now names the
person, and the narrowness stays tested with words that are not particles.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
